  "mathematical_scope": [
    "One loss from CurrentJets clause2 is chosen before every spatial order; no parameter tower or loss is replaced.",
    "Actual sample H^(3/4) is uniformly bounded using IsMaterialData at the same K.cell and sample. Reference and genuine difference jets give an explicit E0 envelope.",
    "The true canonicalLengthInverse reference atom supplies the inverse affine cost. Its power changes only the numeric exponent, never the state derivative loss.",
    "Every actual unit atom is pulled back by the existing inverse affine map. Four literal atoms give the potential and positive-piece divided fields; negative-piece divided terms are genuinely gated out.",
    "The existing sector-state center has literal lift z and exact grading stateGrading(z-reference)+abs(parameter). Packing yields the frozen SectorCanonicalJetBounds with unchanged K/base/epsilon.",
    "The sample E0 floor is explicit and is available for the already enlarged material data. This leaf neither asserts CurrentJets nor substitutes an arbitrary atom bound for it."
  ],
